[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……レスナ。今日も来たのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... Resna. You came again today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今日はアトリエで調合してみない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Want to try some alchemy at the atelier?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょうごう……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alchemy...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これを……こうして混ぜればいいの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I... mix these ingredients like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうそう。混ぜたらこうして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right! And after mixing, you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "作りたいものを思い浮かべて、ぐるぐるって\nかき混ぜて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Picture what you want to make in your mind, and stir it all together..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ……こう？\u3000作りたいものなんて浮かばないんだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "L-like this? I can't really imagine what I want to make though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ。慣れの問題だから、そこは大丈夫！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, don't worry! That just comes with practice!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちこうやって、よく一緒に調合したんだよ。\nヴァレリアが最初に調合した時はね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We used to do synthesis together all the time like this. The first time you tried alchemy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい。でも、頑張って思い出そうとしても\n何も思い出せないのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry. No matter how hard I try to remember, nothing comes back to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、治してくれたことには感謝してるけど……その",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm grateful that you saved me, but... well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仲良くしてくれようとするのは嬉しい。\nでも、前みたいにって期待には応えられそうにないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I appreciate you trying to be friendly. But I don't think I can live up to your expectations of who I used to be."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そう……だよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah... of course..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、ううん。\n私も……気遣いが足りなかったかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, don't be... I should have been more... considerate..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう帰るわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I should go."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。またね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay... Next time then..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]